    {
      "title": "Свой SQL под правами жильца",
      "text": "Консьерж заводит квартиру «Василёк» и пишет в ней магазин. `me.sql` — один запрос одной транзакцией в сессии Анны, `me.transaction` — несколько запросов одной транзакцией: права те же, что у цепочек, поэтому магазинов Анна видит два — свои. SQL мастер-ключом (`admin`) правами не ограничен и видит все три. Схему дома (`me.schema`, `v2.<имя>`) в своём SQL пишут целиком в кавычках, значения — параметрами. Запись через `me.sql` сбрасывает весь кэш результатов.",
      "code": "await db.createTenant('Василёк');\nawait (await db.in('Василёк')).Shop().create({ name: 'Василёк' }).rows();\nconst count = `select count(*)::int as n from \"${me.schema}\".entity where class = 'Shop'`;\nreturn {\n  'me.sql': await me.sql`select ${'Ромашка'}::text as tenant_name, current_setting('letopis.reason', true) as reason`,\n  'магазинов у Анны (me.transaction)': (await me.transaction((tx) => tx.unsafe(count)))[0].n,\n  'магазинов мастер-ключом': (await admin.unsafe(count))[0].n,\n};",
      "html": "<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createTenant</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Василёк'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Василёк'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Shop</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Василёк'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `select count(*)::int as n from \"${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">me</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">schema</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\".entity where class = 'Shop'`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'me.sql'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> me.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">sql</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`select ${'Ромашка'}::text as tenant_name, current_setting('letopis.reason', true) as reason`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'магазинов у Анны (me.transaction)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> me.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">transaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">tx</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tx.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count)))[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  'магазинов мастер-ключом'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> admin.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">unsafe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count))[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre>",
